{"id":786587,"title":"28｜AutoGen框架介绍","content":"介绍了微软开源的A技能框架Autogen，旨在解决GPTS依赖于特定生态的问题。Autogen支持商业和开源模型的对接，如Kodrama、WitherCoder等，并兼容OpenAI及国内大模型接口。通过Autogen Studio界面可配置模型、技能和工作流，实现类似GPTS的功能。Autogen框架内含用户代理与助理两个默认智能体。用户代理接收需求后传递给助理，后者负责任务规划并指导用户代理执行具体代码。两者通过持续交互完成任务，例如绘制股票价格趋势图。此外，Autogen还支持多智能体协作，创建不同角色组成的团队以处理更复杂的任务。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392682,"user_name":"Geek_7d0b15","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3929039,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"9C8F4BF9C3A9FA","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721534017,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"这部分GPTS在上文课程中讲过吗？ 怎么感觉又衔接不起来了😂","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":392677,"user_name":"Eric","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1205698,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"06BE5025CA56D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/65/c2/5f00485d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721532446,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"AutoGen开源的agent框架","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":392676,"user_name":"Eric","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1205698,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"06BE5025CA56D2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/65/c2/5f00485d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721532375,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"笔记：两个或多个智能体协作完成任务","like_count":0}]}